  "description": "Process a opens a dynaset on row 1 with options dbSeeChanges and lock type dbOptimistic, Edits and assigns N (no Update). Process b then, with errors recorded, updates row 2, row 64 and row 1 of table U by statements, inserts row 200, and edits row 2 through its own dbOptimistic dynaset (Edit/assign/Update). Process a then Updates and reads; b reads rows 1, 2 and 64. Asks which operations are admitted while an optimistic Edit is pending and what a's Update returns.",
